      "content": "3200mg in a day?? wow that sounds like a ton of advil. i'm worried about my stomach though, but i also really need the pain to stop so i can walk around. if i need to take a bigger dose at once to really hit the inflammation, like 1000mg at a time, is that gonna be okay? i'd rather just handle this at home than keep bothering my doctor for every little ache.",
